        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, spiral-seam duct, stainless steel, s= 0.8mm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, spiral-seam duct, stainless steel, s= 0.8mm
Disposal of a spiral-seam duct, made of stainless steel sheet, sheet thickness 0.8 mm, total weight: 7.2 kg/m2. Including average material for joining ducts. Suspension band, shock absorbing EPDM rubber, threaded rod, suspension profile for fixation on walls or ceilings.;
UUID: 524a5fdd-65ba-466c-8b5b-f516d3efac07
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces, copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on production input data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_524a5fdd-65ba-466c-8b5b-f516d3efac07.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
